return {
    ["      善于观察筹谋、在一切之前做好预期，一直是阿尔杰的操守。然而现在，他的心理预期正在崩塌——\n      家具喷涌着牛奶，天花板降下蘑菇，散落的泥土像血肉一样鼓动，随后大副先生从土堆中探出头来。\n      “您好，我听船长说了，您想要之前对付原始月亮信徒的那种蘑菇。”弗兰克·李露出了热情的笑容。“得请您等一等。嗯，想来一些果汁吗？”\n      “果汁……”阿尔杰目光凝重地看向房间角落，有根长在牛肉上的藤条正流出清香的汁液。\n      “不了，我暂时不渴。”阿尔杰谨慎地摇了摇头。\n      弗兰克略显遗憾，不过很快再次露出笑容：“船长说我可以索取一些合理报酬……阿尔杰先生，您是水手途径的高序列非凡者……”\n      阿尔杰警惕了起来。\n      “能提供一些您海洋生物化后的血肉吗？我想知道这种‘鱼肉’能否和蘑菇发生反应……”"] = "      Being observant and calculating, and preparing for everything in advance, had always been Alger's code of conduct. However, his psychological expectations were now collapsing—\n      Furniture was spewing milk, mushrooms were descending from the ceiling, and the scattered soil was pulsating like flesh, after which Mr. First Mate poked his head out from the pile of dirt.\n      \"Hello, I heard from the Captain that you wanted the kind of mushrooms used against the Primordial Moon believers previously.\" Frank Lee revealed an enthusiastic smile. \"You'll have to wait a moment. Hmm, would you like some fruit juice?\"\n      \"Fruit juice...\" Alger looked solemnly toward the corner of the room, where a vine growing on beef was dripping with fragrant juice.\n      \"No, I'm not thirsty for now.\" Alger shook his head cautiously.\n      Frank looked slightly regretful, but soon smiled again: \"The Captain said I could request some reasonable compensation... Mr. Alger, you are a high-Sequence Beyonder of the Sailor pathway...\"\n      Alger became vigilant.\n      \"Could you provide some of your flesh after your marine creature transformation? I want to know if this 'fish meat' can react with the mushrooms...\"",
