    ["<Assistant_Title1>【血月杀戮】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得血月杀戮套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Blood Moon Slaughter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Blood Moon Slaughter outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【谁是恶龙】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>城市漫游</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>猎龙帮除了龙什么都猎，这次他们猎到你了。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(939,1337)]|-6790;34457;-2533;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Who Is the Evil Dragon】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>City Roaming</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The Dragon Hunter Gang hunts everything except dragons, and this time they've hunted you.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main story, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(939,1337)]|-6790;34457;-2533;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Highlight>仅限猎杀时刻活动期间</>于【命运祭坛】处召唤命运人偶，将其击败可获得猩红遗物材料。王城区域危机四伏，建议<Highlight>团队前往挑战</>。"] = "<Highlight> Only during the Hunting Time event </>, you can summon a Fate Marionette at the [Altar of Fate]. Defeating it will grant Scarlet Relic materials. The Royal City area is fraught with danger; it is recommended that a <Highlight> team go to challenge it </>.",
